  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "碳足跡",
    "sub_ename": "CARBON FOOTPRINT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之目的主要是介紹碳足跡。碳足跡定義為組織、產品或個人排放二氧化碳總量。為因應全球二氧化碳減排與綠色消費趨勢，部分國際產品已要求生態化設計與碳足跡提供，生產者需提出產品生命週期之碳足跡與生態說明書。目前產業相關人才缺乏，藉由本課程講授相關專業知識與實務個案訓練，並可因應未來產業人才需求。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is for students to understand a carbon footprint. A carbon footprint has historically been defined as \"the total set of greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions caused by an organization, event, product or person. In order to fit the trend of mitigation of carbon footprints and green consumption, some of the products have been required to show their eco-design and carbon footprint. The producer should provide the carbon footprint by the life cycle assignment (LCA) calculated and ecological report. Nowadays, the human resources on the skills are very less in the relevance private sector. The course can offer the training on the carbon footprint calculation and professional knowledge in particular. The course also can support the talent to the private sector demand in the future.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解碳足跡的基本概念。",
      "describe_en": "To understand the basic theory of the carbon footprint."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解碳足跡的計算要求。",
      "describe_en": "To understand how to calculate the carbon footprint."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解進行碳足跡查證之注意要項，滿足企業內部查證人員訓練要求。",
      "describe_en": "To understand the requirements of the Clean Development Mechanism (CDM) to fulfill the skill demand of the internal technical specialist in the private sector."
    }
  ],
